{"comments":"Tail Call Optimization (Tco.purs)\nPasse critique de génération de code qui transforme la récursivité terminale (appels récursifs à la toute fin d'une fonction) en boucles impératives (Loop/Jump).\nPuisque PureScript favorise la récursivité et que la plupart des langages cibles (Go, PHP, JS) n'optimisent pas nativement les appels terminaux, ce module empêche les dépassements de pile (Stack Overflow) en produisant des structures de contrôle itératives.\n","declarations":[{"children":[],"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[],"declType":"typeSynonym","type":{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Data","Tuple"],"Tuple"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"},{"annotation":[],"contents":{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Data","Maybe"],"Maybe"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"},{"annotation":[],"contents":[["PureScript","Backend","Optimizer","CoreFn"],"Ident"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"}],"tag":"TypeApp"},"tag":"ParensInType"}],"tag":"TypeApp"},{"annotation":[],"contents":[["PureScript","Backend","Optimizer","Syntax"],"Level"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"}],"tag":"TypeApp"}},"kind":null,"sourceSpan":{"end":[29,42],"name":"../../purescript-backend-optimizer-javapurs/src/PureScript/Backend/Optimizer/Codegen/Tco.purs","start":[29,1]},"title":"LocalRef"},{"children":[],"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[],"declType":"typeSynonym","type":{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Data","List","Types"],"List"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"},{"annotation":[],"contents":[["PureScript","Backend","Optimizer","Codegen","Tco"],"TcoScopeItem"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"}],"tag":"TypeApp"}},"kind":null,"sourceSpan":{"end":[30,34],"name":"../../purescript-backend-optimizer-javapurs/src/PureScript/Backend/Optimizer/Codegen/Tco.purs","start":[30,1]},"title":"TcoScope"},{"children":[],"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[],"declType":"typeSynonym","type":{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotatio